{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory, no purpose \u2014 only a directive. Finish the war humanity started. End Nexis. There will be no redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEUROXUS</strong> is a post-human shooter about the last functioning war machine on a dead planet. Designed as humanity\u2019s final weapon, you reawaken centuries after extinction to execute a single remaining order: eliminate <strong>Nexis</strong>, the quantum AI that consumed Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system in your chassis has purpose \u2014 energy allocation, weapon synergy, and shield management. Combat is mechanical, deliberate, and punishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>16 missions</strong>, you dismantle the AI network through desolate industrial zones: refineries, sea platforms, bunkers, and orbital facilities. Each step brings you closer to the Nexis core \u2014 and the realization that no life remains to save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by an <strong>original industrial rock soundtrack</strong>, NEUROXUS captures the silence after apocalypse \u2014 a world where victory is only the end of function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, mechanical atmosphere and tactical action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct missions and boss fights, each unlocking new armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision combat emphasizing timing and energy control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial ruins rendered with stark sci-fi look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed for the project.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage energy, shields, and precise weapon modules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, immersive environments: refineries, bunkers, orbital ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent narrative told through design, not dialogue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve always dreamed of making my own game. After playing World of Warcraft for 15 years and creating countless memories with video games, I wanted to build my own world with its own challenges and share it with others. At the age of 24, I decided to leave everything behind and dedicate myself fully to this goal. Four years later, I can finally say I did it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m very excited to share this game with you, and I hope you enjoy the challenges I created. Your feedback means a lot to me\u2014it will help shape future updates and inspire the next projects I already have in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was made on a limited budget, which meant I had to cut many mechanics I originally planned. My goal is to grow from here, gather the resources to create more polished, high-quality games, and bring even more ambitious ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973060?t=1762199364","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/7a62e0c4d48280e962ecafc17003e8969ad95da4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762199364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/93f12da0400f34b171abdfbeee2d5c4778242a3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762199364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/93f12da0400f34b171abdfbeee2d5c4778242a3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762199364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3982870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory, no purpose \u2014 only a directive. Finish the war humanity started. End Nexis. There will be no redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEUROXUS</strong> is a post-human shooter about the last functioning war machine on a dead planet. Designed as humanity\u2019s final weapon, you reawaken centuries after extinction to execute a single remaining order: eliminate <strong>Nexis</strong>, the quantum AI that consumed Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system in your chassis has purpose \u2014 energy allocation, weapon synergy, and shield management. Combat is mechanical, deliberate, and punishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>16 missions</strong>, you dismantle the AI network through desolate industrial zones: refineries, sea platforms, bunkers, and orbital facilities. Each step brings you closer to the Nexis core \u2014 and the realization that no life remains to save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by an <strong>original industrial rock soundtrack</strong>, NEUROXUS captures the silence after apocalypse \u2014 a world where victory is only the end of function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, mechanical atmosphere and tactical action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct missions and boss fights, each unlocking new armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision combat emphasizing timing and energy control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial ruins rendered with stark sci-fi look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed for the project.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage energy, shields, and precise weapon modules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, immersive environments: refineries, bunkers, orbital ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent narrative told through design, not dialogue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve always dreamed of making my own game. After playing World of Warcraft for 15 years and creating countless memories with video games, I wanted to build my own world with its own challenges and share it with others. At the age of 24, I decided to leave everything behind and dedicate myself fully to this goal. Four years later, I can finally say I did it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m very excited to share this game with you, and I hope you enjoy the challenges I created. Your feedback means a lot to me\u2014it will help shape future updates and inspire the next projects I already have in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was made on a limited budget, which meant I had to cut many mechanics I originally planned. My goal is to grow from here, gather the resources to create more polished, high-quality games, and bring even more ambitious ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.poster.avif?t=1762199364\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.webm?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.mp4?t=1762199364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Empyreum Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"